commit 8fba1581a272caee9057ef11d92b337540ef6342
Author: nckrtl <nick.retel@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 4 13:09:18 2026 +0200

    Remove OpenCode, PolyScope, and Agent IDE active product surface
    
    Release A drops ADE public commands/routes/permissions, OpenCode and PolyScope
    catalog tools, workspace adapter machinery, and Agent IDE crash notification
    while keeping generic worktree workspaces and the current Codex contract.
    Adds rollback-safe storage cleanup migration and removal-only legacy host
    teardown with fail-closed PATH-stub harness coverage.

